    eventName: 
  - speaker: 6
    dialogueText: "\u2026No."
    choicesTexts: []
    answersIndexes: 
    dialogueEnd: 0
    eventName: 
  - speaker: 6
    dialogueText: "That simply will not do. Close, perhaps, in spirit\u2014but entirely
      wrong in practice."
    choicesTexts: []
    answersIndexes: 
    dialogueEnd: 0
    eventName: 
  - speaker: 6
    dialogueText: I suggest you reconsider. I will not open for that.
    choicesTexts: []
    answersIndexes: 
    dialogueEnd: 1
    eventName: 
  - speaker: 6
    dialogueText: Oh. How unfortunate.
    choicesTexts: []
    answersIndexes: 
    dialogueEnd: 0
    eventName: 
  - speaker: 6
    dialogueText: "Still, not knowing doesn\u2019t change anything. I cannot open
